                                    "body": {
                                        "processed": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022subhead color-accent\u0022\u003EGovernment\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Ch1\u003ECity of Chandler, AZ\u003C\/h1\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith nearly 250,000 residents relying on it, the City of Chandler\u2019s website needed to be more than functional\u2014it had to be intuitive, reliable, and built for scale. By integrating critical systems that support the city\u2019s daily operations, we delivered a seamless digital experience that empowers both residents and internal teams with clarity, efficiency, and ease of use.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca class=\u0022button transparent\u0022 href=\u0022https:\/\/www.chandleraz.gov\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 tabindex=\u00220\u0022\u003EView Website\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n"
