                                            "processed": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022h3\u0022\u003EThe Problem\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe existing experience made it difficult for residents to quickly find what they needed.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e0d161838a6db99ebcdd60a84900e048f\u0022\u003ENavigation built around departments, not users\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022eab52efd7537924f39ba6773424ababff\u0022\u003EOutdated, content-heavy experience\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022eb490e998e54153345e464a94372a7e26\u0022\u003EKey services hard to find\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003C\/ul\u003E\n"
