                                        "verticalAlign": false,
                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022h3\u0022\u003EThe Approach\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWe restructured both the experience and the underlying system to better serve users.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022eb854239720dc19a01127e4a7bbb95c9b\u0022\u003EShifted to audience-based navigation\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022ea9ae87bdb592b9c8625e41a2ceb70816\u0022\u003EBuilt flexible Drupal architecture\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e88d5bc88b73b8312bf12ab35e3010994\u0022\u003EImproved search and content structure\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e991c6dc45ebe16928340e0c2ac815c6e\u0022\u003EIntegrated essential city systems\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003C\/ul\u003E\n"
